					<Content>﻿<?ACE 4?>	‘Regulation (EU) 2022/2065 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 19 October 2022 on a Single Market for Digital Services and Amending Directive 2000/31/EC (Digital Services Act)’, https://eur-lex.europa.eu/ legal-content/en/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32022R2065 (accessed 8 June 2023).﻿</Content>
