				</EndnoteRange>
				<Br />
				<EndnoteRange Self="uc2e" SourceEndnote="uc2d">
					<Content>﻿<?ACE 4?>	European Parliament legislative resolution of 13 March 2024 on the proposal for a regulation of the European Parliament and of the Council to lay down harmonized rules on Artificial Intelligence (Artificial Intelligence Act) and to amend certain Union Legislative Acts (COM(2021)0206 – C9-0146/2021 – 2021/0106(COD)), https://www.europarl.europa.eu/doceo/document/TA9-2024-0138_EN.pdf (accessed 8 April 2024).﻿</Content>
				</EndnoteRange>
				<Br />
				<EndnoteRange Self="uc30" SourceEndnote="uc2f">
					<Content>﻿<?ACE 4?>	Ibid.; ‘Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 13 December 2023’.﻿</Content>
